---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: "Stats Lab"
seoTitle: "Stats Lab: free Business Mathematics and Statistics tools, step by step"
permalink: /tools/stats/
description: "Free tools for B.B.A. Business Mathematics and Statistics: matrices and Cramer's rule, interest, percentages, probability, mean, median, mode and standard deviation, correlation, regression, time series and index numbers, each worked step by step."
keywords: ["business mathematics", "business statistics", "matrix calculator", "standard deviation", "correlation", "regression", "index numbers"]
pageCss: /assets/or-lab/or-lab.css
---
<div class="wrap page">
  <header class="page-head">
    <p class="back back-top"><a href="/tools/">← All labs</a></p>
    <p class="eyebrow">For students</p>
    <h1>{{ statlab.name }}</h1>
    <p class="lead">{{ statlab.intro }}</p>
  </header>

  <div class="lab-units">
    {% for u in statlab.units %}
    <section class="lab-unit" aria-labelledby="unit-{{ loop.index }}">
      <h2 class="lab-unit-head" id="unit-{{ loop.index }}"><span class="unit-no">Unit {{ u.no }}</span><span class="unit-name">{{ u.name }}</span></h2>
      <ul class="lab-tools">
        {% for slug in u.tools %}{% set t = statlab.tools[slug] %}
        <li>
          <h3><a href="/tools/{{ slug }}/">{{ t.title }}</a></h3>
          <p>{{ t.text }}</p>
        </li>
        {% endfor %}
      </ul>
    </section>
    {% endfor %}
  </div>

  <section class="lab-unit" aria-labelledby="about-lab">
    <h2 class="lab-unit-head" id="about-lab"><span class="unit-no">How to use them</span></h2>
    <div class="lab-about">
      <p>Work the problem by hand first, then enter it here to check each step: the tools show the tables and the arithmetic in the order you would write them in an exam, not just the final answer.</p>
      <p>Everything is worked out in your browser, so nothing you type is sent anywhere. “Copy link to this problem” gives a link that opens the same problem, ready to share with a class.</p>
      <p>For Operations Research for Managers, see <a href="/tools/or/">{{ orlab.name }}</a>.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</div>
